  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 305.02 Training of Bear Dogs. Training of bear dogs shall be allowed from July 1 through August 31 statewide and in accordance with RSA 207:12-a.\n\nSource. #6193, eff 2-22-96; ss by #6292, eff 7-20-96; ss by #7289, eff 6-1-00, EXPIRED: 6-1-08\n\nNew. #9236, INTERIM, eff 8-22-08, EXPIRED: 2-18-09\n\nNew. #9405, eff 3-7-09; ss by #10347, eff 5-22-13; ss by #11114, eff 6-3-16; ss by #12591, eff 7-25-18; ss by #14308, eff 7-10-25, EXPIRES: 7-10-35",
